    "Verify in CI with: npm --prefix docs/fern run nav:check",
    "",
    "Why: Fern requires the nightly nav (versions/nightly.yml, paths relative",
    "to itself) and the frozen-release nav (../index.yml, paths relative to",
    "docs/) to be maintained separately, with different path conventions, and",
    "only the first is validated by `fern check`. Hand-maintaining both is how",
    "pages silently vanish from a channel."
